  "debtToEquityTTM": null,
  "description": "Rocket Companies, Inc. is a leading enterprise focused on leveraging technology across the real estate, mortgage, and e-commerce industries, with operations spanning the United States and Canada. The firm organizes its activities into two principal divisions: direct engagement with consumers and a collaborative partner network. Its extensive suite of solutions encompasses: Rocket Mortgage: A primary provider of mortgage lending services. Amrock: Offering vital services such as title insurance, property valuation, and transaction settlement. Rocket Homes: A comprehensive platform for home searching and a referral network connecting clients with real estate agents, employing technology to simplify the home buying and selling journey. Rocket Auto: An online marketplace for automotive retail that facilitates centralized and virtual support for car purchases. Rocket Loans: A service specializing in online personal loans. Core Digital Media: A digital advertising agency prominent in the mortgage, insurance, and education sectors. Rocket Solar: Connecting homeowners to digital financing options for solar energy installations through expert advisors. Truebill: A personal finance application designed to help users manage various aspects of their financial lives. Lendesk: A technology services company providing point-of-sale systems for mortgage professionals and loan origination software for private lenders. Edison Financial: A digital mortgage brokerage. Beyond these specific brands, Rocket Companies also undertakes the initiation, finalization, sale, and servicing of agency-conforming loans. Established in 1985, the company maintains its headquarters in Detroit, Michigan, and operates as a subsidiary of Rock Holdings, Inc.",
